00:59:27,670 --> 00:59:29,569
Then I had a few pieces of gimbap...

1522
00:59:29,570 --> 00:59:31,340
before getting ready for dinner.

1523
00:59:32,670 --> 00:59:34,879
After I wipe the griddle...

1524
00:59:34,880 --> 00:59:37,950
And do you remember how tteokgalbi was a bit bland?

1525
00:59:38,050 --> 00:59:40,210
So I need to add more sauce.

1526
00:59:40,420 --> 00:59:41,980
Then our...

1527
00:59:42,180 --> 00:59:45,390
Jeong Hye washes the dishes thoroughly.

1528
00:59:45,620 --> 00:59:48,090
Jeong Hye's in a trance.

1529
00:59:49,120 --> 00:59:50,430
She's completely lost in washing dishes.

1530
00:59:51,360 --> 00:59:53,329
The dishes never end.

1531
00:59:53,330 --> 00:59:55,299
- It just never ends.
- It doesn't end.

1532
00:59:55,300 --> 00:59:58,399
But of all people, she's best at it.

1533
00:59:58,400 --> 00:59:59,400
She's fast too.

1534
00:59:59,401 --> 01:00:01,599
I used to work part-time in many places.

1535
01:00:01,600 --> 01:00:03,540
I worked at a pork cutlet place too.

1536
01:00:03,710 --> 01:00:05,239
While working at the pork cutlet place,

1537
01:00:05,240 --> 01:00:07,410
I briefly dated the owner.

1538
01:00:07,840 --> 01:00:08,840
My goodness.

1539
01:00:09,110 --> 01:00:10,509
(She said something she shouldn't have...)

1540
01:00:10,510 --> 01:00:11,909
(right in front of Cheol Yong.)

1541
01:00:11,910 --> 01:00:12,950
It was...

1542
01:00:13,480 --> 01:00:14,550
It was just for a moment.

1543
01:00:14,880 --> 01:00:16,049
I know everything, Jeong Hye.

1544
01:00:16,050 --> 01:00:17,419
Do you want to know what I know?

1545
01:00:17,420 --> 01:00:18,590
(He only knows about love.)

1546
01:00:18,750 --> 01:00:19,750
(Throwing)

1547
01:00:19,751 --> 01:00:22,420
My brother, Byeong Cheol, the owner of the eel place.

1548
01:00:22,790 --> 01:00:23,989
You dated him too, didn't you?

1549
01:00:23,990 --> 01:00:25,929
I didn't date him.

1550
01:00:25,930 --> 01:00:27,959
You kissed him. But you wouldn't kiss me.

1551
01:00:27,960 --> 01:00:29,700
(Kiss-lover Cheol Yong is bitter about it.)

1552
01:00:29,900 --> 01:00:31,769
I didn't really date him.

1553
01:00:31,770 --> 01:00:34,369
- We just went to...
- I heard it all.

1554
01:00:34,370 --> 01:00:36,399
We just went to karaoke together a few times.

1555
01:00:36,400 --> 01:00:37,770
Why do you go to karaoke?

1556
01:00:37,910 --> 01:00:38,940
Because it's fun!

1557
01:00:40,210 --> 01:00:44,010
Did you sing "Kinky Boots," "Moulin Rouge!" and "Mama Mia?"

1558
01:00:44,150 --> 01:00:45,749
Did you sing those there? Just tell me.

1559
01:00:45,750 --> 01:00:47,920
What can I do when those are my songs?

1560
01:00:48,650 --> 01:00:50,520
That's how she flirts with men.

1561
01:00:51,250 --> 01:00:53,390
She uses that to charm all the men.

1562
01:00:53,490 --> 01:00:55,159
What about you?

1563
01:00:55,160 --> 01:00:57,629
You subtly show off your biceps when you make the patty.

1564
01:00:57,630 --> 01:00:59,290
Just showing your charm like that.

1565
01:00:59,390 --> 01:01:00,530
(The middle-aged couple is upset with each other.)

1566
01:01:01,130 --> 01:01:03,200
There they go again. Goodness.

1567
01:01:05,530 --> 01:01:08,870
From east to west

1568
01:01:09,270 --> 01:01:11,840
My love is everywhere

1569
01:01:13,510 --> 01:01:16,510
My love, Lee Jeong Hye

1570
01:01:17,110 --> 01:01:18,180
- Where is she?
- Lee Jeong Hye?

1571
01:01:19,610 --> 01:01:21,350
Did you just say Lee Jeong Hye?

1572
01:01:21,580 --> 01:01:22,620
Lee Jeong Hye.

1573
01:01:23,120 --> 01:01:24,920
I'm Sunwoo Jeong Hye.

1574
01:01:25,350 --> 01:01:27,220
(Goodness me.)

1575
01:01:28,120 --> 01:01:30,730
Who is Lee Jeong Hye?

1576
01:01:32,090 --> 01:01:34,330
Who is Lee Jeong Hye?

1577
01:01:34,430 --> 01:01:35,499
(The middle-aged couple's final love ended in disaster.)

1578
01:01:35,500 --> 01:01:36,530
Lee Jeong Hye...

1579
01:01:37,100 --> 01:01:39,399
- Who is Lee Jeong Hye?
- Calm down.

1580
01:01:39,400 --> 01:01:41,600
Back when you used to work at the gas station,

1581
01:01:41,900 --> 01:01:45,010
you changed your name from Lee Jeong Hye to Sunwoo Jeong Hye.

1582
01:01:45,440 --> 01:01:47,980
Who changes their surname?

1583
01:01:49,810 --> 01:01:52,709
Who changes their surname?

1584
01:01:52,710 --> 01:01:54,450
(Cheol Yong lacks common sense.)

1585
01:01:55,180 --> 01:01:58,590
Love isn't for everyone

1586
01:01:58,790 --> 01:02:03,289
- Love isn't for everyone - Love isn't for everyone

1587
01:02:03,290 --> 01:02:04,290
(Hoping they work it out smoothly)

1588
01:02:04,490 --> 01:02:05,889
(After the lovers' quarrel)

1589
01:02:05,890 --> 01:02:07,460
(Space Rice Cake)

1590
01:02:07,660 --> 01:02:10,300
- Shouldn't you start prepping now?
- I'm about to start now.

1591
01:02:12,170 --> 01:02:14,340
I'm spending the whole day just cleaning the griddle.

1592
01:02:14,770 --> 01:02:17,509
- When is the part-timer coming?
- The part-timer?

1593
01:02:17,510 --> 01:02:19,309
- Please.
- The part-timer...

1594
01:02:19,310 --> 01:02:20,369
Please.

1595
01:02:20,370 --> 01:02:22,610
- will come when it's time.
- Now is the time.

1596
01:02:23,380 --> 01:02:25,450
(First, the POS system)

1597
01:02:25,610 --> 01:02:27,650
(Second, high table seating)

1598
01:02:27,850 --> 01:02:30,020
(Third, waiting zone)

1599
01:02:30,250 --> 01:02:32,090
(And the part-timer...)

1600
01:02:32,320 --> 01:02:35,560
(who's still nowhere in sight)

1601
01:02:35,960 --> 01:02:38,130
Come and see, part-timer.

1602
01:02:39,060 --> 01:02:40,830
I'm the youngest member here.

1603
01:02:41,230 --> 01:02:44,200
You'll be the youngest when you come.

1604
01:02:44,400 --> 01:02:45,729
That's right. Yu Jin won't be...

1605
01:02:45,730 --> 01:02:47,029
- the youngest anymore.
- Right?

1606
01:02:47,030 --> 01:02:49,239
- I'll train the youngest.
- That...

1607
01:02:49,240 --> 01:02:51,669
- doesn't go according to age.
- Don't do anything.

1608
01:02:51,670 --> 01:02:54,109
- It goes according to experience.
- Sure.

1609
01:02:54,110 --> 01:02:56,209
The person who joins last is the youngest.

1610
01:02:56,210 --> 01:02:59,409
Then does the previous youngest have to teach them a lesson or not?

1611
01:02:59,410 --> 01:03:00,920
Come here!

1612
01:03:01,550 --> 01:03:02,680
(Not very good)

1613
01:03:02,920 --> 01:03:04,489
No. It should be like, "What do you think you're doing?"

1614
01:03:04,490 --> 01:03:05,550
(Demonstrating)

1615
01:03:06,150 --> 01:03:07,720
- What do you think you're doing?
- I'm sorry.

1616
01:03:10,160 --> 01:03:11,329
- I'm sorry.
- Corner them like that.

1617
01:03:11,330 --> 01:03:12,490
Are you ready to do that?

1618
01:03:12,730 --> 01:03:13,789
I'm ready.

1619
01:03:13,790 --> 01:03:15,599
- Whoever comes, whatever the age.
- I'll do it.

1620
01:03:15,600 --> 01:03:16,960
What do you think you're doing?

1621
01:03:17,060 --> 01:03:18,169
(Playing the part of the part-timer)

1622
01:03:18,170 --> 01:03:19,599
Go up the stairs.

1623
01:03:19,600 --> 01:03:21,269
- But...
- Don't you want to go upstairs?

1624
01:03:21,270 --> 01:03:23,299
I came here thinking it was a TV show.

1625
01:03:23,300 --> 01:03:25,039
Why are you being so harsh to me?

1626
01:03:25,040 --> 01:03:26,409
(Variation of a past question)

1627
01:03:26,410 --> 01:03:27,579
- Hey.
- But...

1628
01:03:27,580 --> 01:03:30,409
you don't seem to be doing anything. This is so funny.

1629
01:03:30,410 --> 01:03:31,780
Follow me into the fridge.

1630
01:03:32,110 --> 01:03:34,550
(Okay.)

1631
01:03:35,120 --> 01:03:37,589
Haven't you heard, Yu Jin?

1632
01:03:37,590 --> 01:03:39,820
I'll be joining the next season for "Earth Arcade."

1633
01:03:40,250 --> 01:03:41,320
Hey!

1634
01:03:42,120 --> 01:03:43,259
(No one is more fun to tease than this youngest.)

1635
01:03:43,260 --> 01:03:44,260
Hey!

1636
01:03:44,430 --> 01:03:45,690
- Why?
- You...

1637
01:03:46,190 --> 01:03:48,499
- That's...
- Yes?

1638
01:03:48,500 --> 01:03:50,199
That's my last pride.

1639
01:03:50,200 --> 01:03:52,199
- Really?
- Do you know how hard I worked...

1640
01:03:52,200 --> 01:03:54,040
to keep this post as the youngest?

1641
01:03:54,170 --> 01:03:57,970
I can't do anything about it because they offered it to me.

1642
01:03:58,010 --> 01:03:59,110
(Getting furious)

1643
01:03:59,240 --> 01:04:00,710
Follow me into the fridge.

1644
01:04:01,210 --> 01:04:02,580
Yu Jin.

1645
01:04:02,740 --> 01:04:04,649
I was born in 2008.

1646
01:04:04,650 --> 01:04:06,709
I hope you treat me well.

1647
01:04:06,710 --> 01:04:08,450
(It's less of a simulation and more about teasing her.)

1648
01:04:08,620 --> 01:04:11,319
- Take the dishwasher.
- Okay.

1649
01:04:11,320 --> 01:04:12,920
(The youngest is coming!)

1650
01:04:13,790 --> 01:04:15,960
- Yu Jin.
- Hey!

1651
01:04:16,660 --> 01:04:19,229
- Is it hot? It's not, right?
- It's okay. It's warm.

1652
01:04:19,230 --> 01:04:20,260
Okay.

1653
01:04:21,060 --> 01:04:22,400
Hey, youngest, clean this up.

1654
01:04:23,500 --> 01:04:26,330
Who's the youngest? Are you the youngest?

1655
01:04:26,970 --> 01:04:27,970
Youngest.

1656
01:04:28,070 --> 01:04:30,399
Why do you keep trying to get more people...

1657
01:04:30,400 --> 01:04:32,169
when I'm doing so well?

1658
01:04:32,170 --> 01:04:33,410
Who knows?

1659
01:04:33,980 --> 01:04:37,210
Employees can always be substituted.

1660
01:04:37,910 --> 01:04:39,010
You never know.

1661
01:04:40,280 --> 01:04:42,580
She might have longer legs than Yu Jin...

1662
01:04:42,820 --> 01:04:44,250
and act cuter than her.

1663
01:04:44,890 --> 01:04:46,390
She might be polite to her seniors...

1664
01:04:46,650 --> 01:04:48,390
and act cute as well.

1665
01:04:48,490 --> 01:04:49,689
Young Ji.

1666
01:04:49,690 --> 01:04:51,430
(Here's the cute act you ordered.)

1667
01:04:51,990 --> 01:04:54,300
- Are you feeling okay?
- Are we going to kiss?

1668
01:04:54,560 --> 01:04:55,629
No.

1669
01:04:55,630 --> 01:04:56,659
(Cheol Yong is always lonely.)

1670
01:04:56,660 --> 01:04:57,699
Cheol Yong!

1671
01:04:57,700 --> 01:04:59,730
(Shouting)

1672
01:05:00,800 --> 01:05:01,970
You should do that only with me.

1673
01:05:02,570 --> 01:05:03,739
But you don't.

1674
01:05:03,740 --> 01:05:06,110
Let me wipe this now.

1675
01:05:07,440 --> 01:05:08,440
What should I do now?

1676
01:05:08,640 --> 01:05:10,749
We have to start prepping now.

1677
01:05:10,750 --> 01:05:12,780
- Okay.
- Can't we rest for a bit?

1678
01:05:13,280 --> 01:05:14,850
Rest? Get some rest after you die.

1679
01:05:16,250 --> 01:05:18,819
Once we're done with lunch, we get ready for dinner.

1680
01:05:18,820 --> 01:05:19,989
Are you serious?

1681
01:05:19,990 --> 01:05:22,760
I know, right? All we did was eat, and now we have to prep.

1682
01:05:23,990 --> 01:05:25,159
Until when...

1683
01:05:25,160 --> 01:05:28,599
Isn't it horrible that lunch service wasn't too busy?

1684
01:05:28,600 --> 01:05:30,800
This is driving me crazy.

1685
01:05:32,100 --> 01:05:34,200
Dinner service is a nightmare.

1686
01:05:34,970 --> 01:05:36,540
I can't even imagine.

1687
01:05:38,210 --> 01:05:42,040
(They start prepping 40 minutes before opening.)

1688
01:05:43,310 --> 01:05:44,880
This looks like the color of tteokgalbi now, right?

1689
01:05:44,980 --> 01:05:47,179
It looks like it. You put more sauce than before, right?

1690
01:05:47,180 --> 01:05:49,019
- Yes. Much more.
- Nice.

1691
01:05:49,020 --> 01:05:51,889
I just went bold with it. I thought it should be a bit salty.

1692
01:05:51,890 --> 01:05:53,719
I think it would be better if it's salty.

1693
01:05:53,720 --> 01:05:55,759
- We have a review.
- A review!

1694
01:05:55,760 --> 01:05:57,559
- Girls!
- Yes?

1695
01:05:57,560 --> 01:05:58,889
We have a review!

1696
01:05:58,890 --> 01:06:02,930
(A review from a valued customer)

1697
01:06:03,200 --> 01:06:04,429
- I'm so curious.
- Tell us.

1698
01:06:04,430 --> 01:06:06,000
- The review says...
- The part-timer is so cute.

1699
01:06:06,230 --> 01:06:08,500
- We were given five stars.
- Five stars.

1700
01:06:09,070 --> 01:06:12,470
"Food tastes great, and the people are so pretty and kind."

1701
01:06:13,170 --> 01:06:15,209
"It was so interesting how the buns of the rice cake burger..."

1702
01:06:15,210 --> 01:06:16,280
"were rice cake."

1703
01:06:16,510 --> 01:06:18,980
"The wasabi sauce has a sharp kick that really makes it."

1704
01:06:19,410 --> 01:06:21,419
"The carrot cake also goes really well with mint,"

1705
01:06:21,420 --> 01:06:22,819
"and it was chewy and tasty."

1706
01:06:22,820 --> 01:06:25,050
"I had a great meal. I'd like to visit again."

1707
01:06:25,220 --> 01:06:26,950
- Nice.
- Okay.

1708
01:06:27,290 --> 01:06:30,060
- Do we have more?
- So far it's this one only.

1709
01:06:30,260 --> 01:06:31,390
This is the first review.

1710
01:06:31,630 --> 01:06:34,060
- Nice.
- Please leave us more reviews!

1711
01:06:35,460 --> 01:06:38,069
(After the brief joy from the positive review...)

1712
01:06:38,070 --> 01:06:39,129
When the part-timer comes,

1713
01:06:39,130 --> 01:06:40,400
tell her how to make the pomegranate ade.

1714
01:06:41,000 --> 01:06:43,770
Let's keep the greetings brief.

1715
01:06:45,140 --> 01:06:46,569
Let's just greet her with a nod.

1716
01:06:46,570 --> 01:06:48,739
- We'll just greet her with a nod.
- Okay.

1717
01:06:48,740 --> 01:06:50,210
Hold on.

1718
01:06:50,880 --> 01:06:54,379
And an introduction. "Hello, I'm Lee Young Ji."

1719
01:06:54,380 --> 01:06:56,179
Seeing that she's not here yet,

1720
01:06:56,180 --> 01:06:57,690
I think she'll be here at a really busy time.

1721
01:06:59,250 --> 01:07:00,790
Goheung feels like last year.

1722
01:07:01,960 --> 01:07:02,989
I see.

1723
01:07:02,990 --> 01:07:04,230
(It's only been two days.)

1724
01:07:04,860 --> 01:07:07,800
Check when the part-timer arrives. We have to pay her accordingly.

1725
01:07:08,660 --> 01:07:09,730
Is there an hourly pay?

1726
01:07:10,300 --> 01:07:12,970
Isn't this just volunteer work?

1727
01:07:13,100 --> 01:07:15,340
(The shamelessness of wanting an unpaid worker)

1728
01:07:15,600 --> 01:07:18,040
(Meanwhile, Eun Ji is done washing the dishes.)

1729
01:07:18,310 --> 01:07:19,340
What can I do for you?

1730
01:07:19,470 --> 01:07:22,110
(They're already tired even before opening.)

1731
01:07:22,410 --> 01:07:23,410
What can I do for you?

1732
01:07:23,411 --> 01:07:24,549
(She's about to faint.)

1733
01:07:24,550 --> 01:07:26,150
- What do you need?
- Catch your breath.

1734
01:07:26,450 --> 01:07:28,049
Catch your breath. Get some rest.

1735
01:07:28,050 --> 01:07:29,549
Get ready, and think about how you'll teach the part-timer...

1736
01:07:29,550 --> 01:07:30,890
how to make the pomegranate ade.

1737
01:07:31,090 --> 01:07:34,519
I'll teach the part-timer how to make the pomegranate ade.

1738
01:07:34,520 --> 01:07:37,089
- We'll just greet her with a nod.
- With a nod.

1739
01:07:37,090 --> 01:07:38,430
- A nod.
- Hello.

1740
01:07:38,790 --> 01:07:41,600
- We really don't have the time.
- We really don't.

1741
01:07:42,200 --> 01:07:44,030
No matter who comes in, we can't greet them.

1742
01:07:45,300 --> 01:07:46,429
Even if it's Beyonce,

1743
01:07:46,430 --> 01:07:47,940
- we can't greet her.
- We can't.

1744
01:07:48,740 --> 01:07:49,740
Part-timer.

1745
01:07:50,970 --> 01:07:52,110
Greet the camera.

1746
01:07:52,640 --> 01:07:54,580
There's no time to hesitate. The pomegranate ade.

1747
01:07:55,340 --> 01:07:56,340
Go upstairs.

1748
01:07:56,980 --> 01:07:58,550
- Good job.
- Yu Jin is good.

1749
01:07:59,250 --> 01:08:00,980
- What should we have her wear?
- We have to dress her too?

1750
01:08:01,380 --> 01:08:03,819
- Let's pick something.
- Do it, Yu Jin.

1751
01:08:03,820 --> 01:08:04,889
(Part-timer strategy simulation)

1752
01:08:04,890 --> 01:08:07,890
- Hello.
- Your uniform. In the restroom.

1753
01:08:08,690 --> 01:08:10,419
- Hello.
- Hello. I'm Lee Young Ji.

1754
01:08:10,420 --> 01:08:12,230
That's Mimi, Yu Jin, and Eun Ji.

1755
01:08:13,130 --> 01:08:14,160
Okay.

1756
01:08:14,630 --> 01:08:16,059
(The part-timer finished changing.)

1757
01:08:16,060 --> 01:08:17,329
I got changed.

1758
01:08:17,330 --> 01:08:18,630
Okay. Then make some pomegranate ades.

1759
01:08:18,830 --> 01:08:20,599
Okay.

1760
01:08:20,600 --> 01:08:21,639
Hold on.

1761
01:08:21,640 --> 01:08:22,670
(Passing by)

1762
01:08:23,440 --> 01:08:25,340
- I'm done.
- Then go outside.

1763
01:08:25,570 --> 01:08:26,610
Okay.

1764
01:08:28,180 --> 01:08:29,210
Okay.

1765
01:08:29,510 --> 01:08:31,779
Aren't you a bit cold? Smile a bit.

1766
01:08:31,780 --> 01:08:33,809
- Do it again, Yu Jin.
- Hello.

1767
01:08:33,810 --> 01:08:36,250
Hello. I'm Young Ji.

1768
01:08:36,950 --> 01:08:39,220
(Laughing)

1769
01:08:41,060 --> 01:08:43,619
- It's scary here.
- A moment, please.

1770
01:08:43,620 --> 01:08:45,260
Let us rest, please.

1771
01:08:46,490 --> 01:08:51,070
(The prep for dinner service is almost done.)

1772
01:08:51,970 --> 01:08:54,640
- I'll start with the buns.
- Okay.

1773
01:08:55,940 --> 01:08:57,040
Please take care of me well.

1774
01:08:58,310 --> 01:08:59,969
It's 30 minutes.

1775
01:08:59,970 --> 01:09:02,139
I'll flip the sign.

1776
01:09:02,140 --> 01:09:04,409
- Let's go.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

1777
01:09:04,410 --> 01:09:05,680
