1786
01:09:31,270 --> 01:09:33,139
When you go a bit easy, then suddenly...

1787
01:09:33,140 --> 01:09:35,139
(Suddenly...)

1788
01:09:35,140 --> 01:09:36,180
That's so true.

1789
01:09:36,480 --> 01:09:38,480
It's hard to tell.

1790
01:09:40,410 --> 01:09:42,119
Why aren't they coming? They should come at exactly 5pm...

1791
01:09:42,120 --> 01:09:43,819
for everything to work out.

1792
01:09:43,820 --> 01:09:45,589
(For some reason, they don't have customers.)

1793
01:09:45,590 --> 01:09:48,089
- I know. You prepared for that.
- I got them prepared.

1794
01:09:48,090 --> 01:09:49,190
I prepared two burgers.

1795
01:09:52,230 --> 01:09:54,630
I'll place an order.

1796
01:09:56,530 --> 01:09:57,800
I'll place an order.

1797
01:09:58,800 --> 01:09:59,870
Are we here?

1798
01:10:00,970 --> 01:10:02,039
I'm so nervous.

1799
01:10:02,040 --> 01:10:04,739
(A car arrives in front of Space Rice Cake.)

1800
01:10:04,740 --> 01:10:05,740
I'm so nervous.

1801
01:10:07,740 --> 01:10:09,209
(Her voice is shaking with excitement.)

1802
01:10:09,210 --> 01:10:10,239
I'm nervous.

1803
01:10:10,240 --> 01:10:13,550
(Her voice is shaking with excitement.)

1804
01:10:14,880 --> 01:10:16,249
Goodness. It's cute.

1805
01:10:16,250 --> 01:10:19,350
(She makes her way over with a racing heart.)

1806
01:10:22,090 --> 01:10:24,529
- I'll place an order.
- Hello.

1807
01:10:24,530 --> 01:10:25,960
(She enters with the words she practiced.)

1808
01:10:29,300 --> 01:10:31,870
- I'll place an order.
- Hello.

1809
01:10:32,230 --> 01:10:33,700
- Hello.
- Goodness!

1810
01:10:33,900 --> 01:10:35,140
What brings you here?

1811
01:10:35,240 --> 01:10:37,840
I heard you opened a rice cake place.

1812
01:10:39,146 --> 01:10:40,185
- What?
- Hello.

1813
01:10:40,210 --> 01:10:42,039
- The strict one.
- Hello.

1814
01:10:42,040 --> 01:10:44,409
- The part-timer?
- Are you going to pay for food?

1815
01:10:44,410 --> 01:10:45,549
I came to help.

1816
01:10:45,550 --> 01:10:47,479
- She's the part-timer.
- The part-timer!

1817
01:10:47,480 --> 01:10:48,619
The part-timer!

1818
01:10:48,620 --> 01:10:50,220
- Part-timer, come over here.
- My gosh. What was that?

1819
01:10:50,320 --> 01:10:51,320
- Part-timer, come over here.
- I wanted to see her face.

1820
01:10:51,321 --> 01:10:52,489
- Come over here.
- Come with me.

1821
01:10:52,490 --> 01:10:53,689
- Go on, part-timer.
- Follow me.

1822
01:10:53,690 --> 01:10:54,889
- Right. Show her the kitchen first.
- Here's our part-timer.

1823
01:10:54,890 --> 01:10:56,359
Say hi to the camera.

1824
01:10:56,360 --> 01:10:57,989
- Hello.
- We're in trouble.

1825
01:10:57,990 --> 01:10:59,289
- Hello.
- You took me by surprise.

1826
01:10:59,290 --> 01:11:00,929
Hello. It's nice to meet you all.

1827
01:11:00,930 --> 01:11:01,930
(A part-timer is here as they wanted.)

1828
01:11:01,930 --> 01:11:02,930
