1848
01:11:54,720 --> 01:11:56,320
(But their happiness is short-lived.)

1849
01:11:56,450 --> 01:11:58,220
(Table 8 is missing their beef burger.)

1850
01:11:58,320 --> 01:12:00,320
(Oh, they ordered 2 servings?)

1851
01:12:00,420 --> 01:12:04,360
(They keep missing orders.)

1852
01:12:04,430 --> 01:12:07,830
