1866
01:12:46,270 --> 01:12:48,170
(It's spicy and delicious!)

1867
01:12:48,300 --> 01:12:50,600
(The second new menu item: Goheung sea margarita)

1868
01:12:50,770 --> 01:12:54,010
(This refreshing drink captures the longing for Goheung's sea.)

1869
01:12:54,440 --> 01:12:57,710
(It's so popular.)

1870
01:12:57,780 --> 01:13:00,850
(Visually stunning and delicious new menu items are coming soon.)

1871
01:13:08,990 --> 01:13:10,590
(Space Rice Cake)
